    "slots":"Exact relative JSON paths -> placeholder keys. Merge placeholderDefaults with each descriptor. Replace an entire <<KEY>> structurally; JSON-serialize, never quote boolean/array/object replacements. Repeated marker keys need not have identical slot values. No unresolved marker allowed. Markers are not CAP syntax.",
    "variants":"Merge a delta only at allowedFamilies with prerequisites in blueprint.md. Family variant references may also describe nested composition (e.g. B-tabs -> tab visibility), not a delta on the parent. Base checks do not approve arbitrary expressions. Fragments need B-root composition.",
    "evidence":"S paths are frontend-relative at revision above; suffixes are line ranges. E resolves to an exact original ID/path/status in evidence-map.json. Usage and behavior are independent; original observed/diagnostic status never upgraded by a derived-family check.",
    "policies":"approved: checked interpreter/builder mechanism with required data. conditional: satisfy named constraints. source-only: implementation-backed, no usage witness. diagnostic-only: explain failure, no working recipe. ignored/unsupported: no generation option. No policy implies browser/effects/backend acceptance."
  },
