    "dependencies":"All referenced aliases must exist in original case and declaration order; built-ins/caller state must be supplied. No invented bindings.",
    "edge":"R-text unless descriptor overrides: evaluated null/undefined -> blank, eval throw -> whole mixed string blank/log. Object/array text coercion only when intentional; display cleanup is separate."
  },
